include/canlin/ui_limits.h:29-31 says CANLIN_UI_FONT_SIZES_MAX 4u is 'its atlas carries the body and both heading sizes' - three faces in a bound of four, the same wording error canlin#105 fixed in render_limits.h. The constant is the UI's own array bound, not the render atlas bound (CANLIN_RENDER_FONT_SIZES), so it needs its own correct wording rather than the same fix. Found by the 2026-11-14 work on k105.

